{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["<b>And to Joseph</b> — Two times in the Masorah: \"וליוסף יולד שני בנים בטרם\" etc. And the other: \"וליוסף אמר מבורכת ה' ארצו\". As we say: whoever joins himself with the community in their distress merits and sees the community's consolation."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:10.980948828Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}